SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con X
DESCRIPTION:💥 Houston… Round X: From one to ten – What a pull it’s been! 🎉\n🎴 Three Days • FREE Entry • 100+ Vendors • Nonstop Trades! \nWhat started as a small weekend card show has turned into a full-on collector movement. Houston TCG Con is back at CCS with Round X: a full 3-day weekend built on trades\, collecting\, and community. More time to dig. More time to trade. More time to find something you didn’t even know you needed. 🃏🤝 \n  \n📅 Date: August 7-9\, 2026 \n⏰ Time: Friday: 3PM – 10PM | Saturday: 10AM – 6PM | Sunday: 10AM – 5PM \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking! \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 100+ TCG Vendors — The Houston Trade Floor\nShop from 100+ curated vendors from across Texas and beyond. Tables will be stacked with: \n✅ Top titles including Pokémon\, Magic: The Gathering\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Digimon\, Weiss Schwarz\, and more. \n✅ Sealed product + booster boxes \n✅ Graded slabs + collector singles \n✅ Binder deals + playable staples \n✅ Japanese imports + hard-to-find pickups \n✅ Sleeves\, top loaders\, storage & accessories \n  \n⚡ Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend\nThis is what Houston TCG Con is known for. Bring your binders\, make the deals you’ve been waiting for\, and connect with collectors. This is where grails change hands and collections level up. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n🤝 Built by the Community — 10 Rounds Strong\nFrom first packs opened around the kitchen table to the cards you still chase today\, this is where it all comes back. The trades\, the stories\, the people you meet along the way\, Round X is a milestone for everyone who grew up with the hobby and never really left it. Bring your crew (and your binder) and relive it with us. Houston TCG Con X is back for a bigger weekend\, with the same community that’s always made it feel like home. \n  \n🎨 Face Painting Fun | Saturday\nStep away from the tables and add some extra style to your TCG Con experience with fun face painting designs. ✨ By @will.and.whimsy \n  \n💼 Vendors – Claim Your Spot!\nApply here 👉🏻 https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \nThis is your chance to connect with the passionate Charlie’s Collectible Show TCG Community! \n  \n🏨 Exclusive Hotel Accommodation\nThinking of traveling to Houston for our show? We’ve reserved a special hotel deal just for you: $79/night rate at TownePlace Suites – just 15 minutes away from CCS Houston. \n🔗 Book your stay: Here \n  \n❤️ Houston TCG community… this is what we built together.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-x/
CATEGORIES:Trading Card Game
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/HTX-Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-TCG-Con-X-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
