SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con XI
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XI – The Long Weekend Belongs to Your Binder\nLabor Day weekend is three days off. Spend at least part of it doing what you actually love. Houston TCG Con XI runs Friday night through Sunday afternoon – Pokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, and more across a curated vendor floor where the person across the table is already looking for what you’ve got. \n  \n📅 Friday\, September 4 to Sunday\, September 6\, 2026 \n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday 10AM – 5PM | Sunday 10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 Every Major TCG on One Curated Houston Floor\nPokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, Dragon Ball Super\, Digimon\, Flesh and Blood\, and more. Find singles\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, Japanese imports\, vintage favorites\, and competitive staples all in one place. \n  \n🤝 Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend\nThis is a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping trip. The vendors here are collectors first. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n💼 Interested in Vending?\nIf you’ve got singles\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or anything else the Houston community is hunting this Labor Day weekend\, apply here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nThree days is worth the trip. Book your stay: Here \nThe last long weekend of summer is yours. Houston TCG Con XI.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xi/
CATEGORIES:Trading Card Game
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HTX-Event-LaunchKIT-TCG-Con-XI.png
