SUMMARY:Anime Market Houston III
DESCRIPTION:💮✨ Anime Market Houston III – Celebrating The Worlds We Love ✨💮\nEvery anime fan has that one series. The one that got you hooked. The character you’ll always root for. The opening song you never skip. The moment that made you say\, “Okay\, I need to see what happens next.” \nThat’s what Anime Market Houston III is all about. \n🗓️ Date & Time: September 12–13\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🌟 Event Highlights\n🛍️ Massive Anime Marketplace\nExplore a floor filled with anime-focused vendors featuring figures\, statues\, Nendoroids\, Gunpla\, manga\, apparel\, blind boxes\, plushies\, accessories\, and fan-made creations inspired by the shows and characters fans love. Find something that reminds you of a favorite moment\, adds to your collection\, or introduces you to something new. 💮✨ \n  \n💖 A Gathering for Anime Lovers\nTalk about your favorite characters\, recommend a series someone has to watch\, compare collections\, show off cosplay\, and connect with fans who understand the excitement of finding a new favorite anime. \n  \n🧸 Collectibles Beyond Anime\nIn addition to anime vendors\, explore our 50+ CCS Family Vendors featuring collectibles like retro video games\, trading cards\, comics\, toys\, and pop culture finds. There’s always something unexpected waiting to be discovered. \n  \n🌸 Interested in Being a Vendor?\nWe’re looking for anime-focused\, non-TCG vendors to join Anime Market Houston III and help grow Houston’s anime community.\n🔗 Vendor Application: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston  \n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🎤 Workshops & Panels → https://forms.gle/KAqqMsUtw4gB23oo9\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6\nHave a love for anime and want to be part of the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a special room rate of $79/night at TownePlace Suites\, just about 15 minutes from the venue!\nBook your stay 👉 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n💮 Your next favorite series\, your next favorite creator\, and your next favorite find could be waiting at Anime Market Houston III. 🎌✨
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/anime-market-houston-iii/
CATEGORIES:Anime
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Event-Launch-Kit-Anime-Market-Houston-III.png
