SUMMARY:CCS $25\,000 Riftbound Invitational Qualifier #5
DESCRIPTION:🏆 CCS Riftbound $25\,000 Invitational Qualifier #5 🏆\nWe’re entering the endgame. Qualifier #5 of the CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational Series is where the leaderboard tightens\, every match matters\, and momentum becomes everything. Fight for points\, pride\, and the $25\,000 guaranteed prize pool. \nCircuit Details → https://charliescollectibleshow.com/events/ccs-50000-riftbound-invitational/ \n  \n🗓 Dates: September 19 – 20 \n📍 Location: Charlie’s Collectible Show\, 9700 Bissonett St Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nTournament Details:\n\n🎟️ Entry Fee: $75 before Sept 5\, $100 After\n🔗 Register Now! 👉 https://topdeck.gg/event/25000-houston-invitational-qualifier-5\n\n  \n🗂️ Format & Structure\n\nStandard Format\nSaturday: 8 Swiss Rounds (Best of 3)\nSunday: 2 Swiss Rounds Based on Attendance\nTop 16 → Single Elimination Finals\nTop 8 → Auto-Invites Awarded to $50K Invitational! 🏆\n\n  \n💰 Guaranteed $25\,000 Prize Pool\n\n1st — $7\,000 + 100 pts + Invite\n2nd — $3\,500 + 80 pts + Invite\n3rd–4th — $2\,000 + 65 pts + Invite\n5th–8th — $1\,000 + 50 pts + Invite\n9th–16th — $375 + 35 pts\n17th–32nd — $225 + 20 pts\n33rd–64th — 10 pts\n65th–128th — 5 pts\n\n  \nEvent Schedule:\n🕔 Registration Opens: 9 AM \n🕔 Player Meeting (Day 1): 10 AM \n🕔 Day 2 Start Time: 9 AM \n  \nSide Events:\n💰 Sunday $5\,000 Event 💰 – Sept 20 @ 11AM ($50 Entry) \nAnother high-stakes showdown for those ready to test their skills! Register Now! 👉 https://topdeck.gg/event/ccs-sunday-5000-riftbound-event-5 \n  \n🎲 SIDE EVENTS (All Weekend Long!) \nOn-demand Tournaments all weekend long and rack up Prize Wall Tickets!! The options are as follows: \n🔹 2-Player 1v1 \n🔹 2v2 Team Multiplayer \n🔹 4-Player Free-For-All \n  \n🛍️ Collectible Marketplace\nBetween rounds\, enjoy access to a curated marketplace featuring: \n\nTCG singles\, sealed\, and accessories\nRetro video games & consoles\nAnime merch\, figures\, and models\nToys and other hobby collectibles\n\nPerfect for grabbing upgrades\, browsing grails\, or just hanging out between matches. \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a special rate of $79/night — ****2 Queens at TownePlace Suites\, only 15 minutes distance from the action! \nBook your stay 👉🏻 Here \n  \n🔔 IMPORTANT REMINDERS: \n\nReal names will appear on printed tournament documents.\nTop 16 decklists will be published!\n\n  \n🔥 Houston’s second last qualifier of the season. ****Defend your turf. Earn your invite. Leave your mark. See you at CCS Riftbound Qualifier #5!
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-25000-riftbound-invitational-qualifier-5/
