SUMMARY:K-Pop Mini Con
DESCRIPTION:🎤✨ K-Pop Mini Con — A Celebration of All Things K-Pop ✨🎤\nGet your lightsticks ready because K-Pop Mini Con is bringing fans together for a full day celebrating everything we love about K-pop! CCS Houston is creating a space for stans\, collectors\, dancers\, creators\, and fans to connect through the music\, fashion\, performances\, and fandom culture that make K-pop so special. 💜✨ \nFrom your favorite groups and iconic eras to album collections\, photocards\, fan creations\, and unforgettable performances\, K-Pop Mini Con is a place where you can celebrate the artists and communities that inspire you. \n  \n🗓️ Date & Time: Saturday\, October 17\, 2026 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry & FREE Parking \n  \n🌟 EVENT HIGHLIGHTS 🌟\n🛍️ K-Pop Marketplace – All Day\nSearching for that one photocard you’ve been missing\, the album you’ve been wanting\, or the perfect piece to represent your favorite group? The marketplace is where the K-pop hunt begins. \n  \n💃 K-Pop Cosplay & Fashion Showcase\nBring your favorite idol looks\, stage-inspired outfits\, fan fashion\, or your own creative style to the showcase! From iconic music video outfits to original fan creations\, show off the looks that make you feel like you belong on stage. ✨ \n  \n🌸 Interested in Being a Vendor?\nHave K-pop-inspired creations\, collectibles\, or fan favorites to share? Join a marketplace where stans can discover new treasures and connect over the artists they love.\nVendor Application: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators \n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🎤 Workshops & Panels → https://forms.gle/x39jXcXuj8hhf8Re7\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \n🛍️ Vendor Application → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \nHave a love for K-pop and want to be part of the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \n  \nBring your friends and join fellow fans for a day celebrating the music\, artists\, and fandom culture that make K-pop unforgettable. CCS K-Pop Mini Con. One fandom. Countless favorites. All under one roof. 🎤💜
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/k-pop-mini-con/
CATEGORIES:Anime
